        "The 3 hashed tune11 .so (2944/7a88/aba7) are retained-but-rejected autotune candidates (all numerical_fail per trials jsonl); they are NOT wired into production (compile cache tuned_config:null, primary_artifact=BASE) but are preserved tuning artifacts, not dead source."
